---
// Walking a thin book with a Market Price (MP) order vs patient Limit Order (LO).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 300;
---
<figure class="sbp3-mp">
  <div class="sbp3-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison showing a 2,000-share MP buy order sweeping Ask 1 (500 at 25,050), Ask 2 (500 at 25,200), and Ask 3 (1,000 at 25,600) for an average of 25,363 VND, versus a patient LO order capped at 25,050 VND.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp3-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Firing a 2,000-share MP buy into a thin book vs setting a Limit Order</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bắn lệnh MP mua 2.000 CP vào sổ mỏng so với đặt lệnh giới hạn (LO)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left: Ask book ladder */}
      <rect x="20" y="54" width="320" height="220" rx="10" class="sbp3-card" />
      <text x="40" y="84" class="sbp3-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Waiting sellers (thin Ask book)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bên bán đang treo (sổ lệnh mỏng)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="122" class="sbp3-body">Ask 1: 25,050 VND × 500</text>
      <text x="40" y="156" class="sbp3-body">Ask 2: 25,200 VND × 500</text>
      <text x="40" y="190" class="sbp3-body sbp3-red">Ask 3: 25,600 VND × 1,000</text>
      <line x1="40" y1="210" x2="320" y2="210" class="sbp3-sep" />
      <text x="40" y="242" class="sbp3-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Best ask looks like 25,050 — only 500 shares</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giá bán 1 nhìn như 25.050 — chỉ có 500 CP</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Top right: MP sweep */}
      <rect x="370" y="54" width="510" height="102" rx="10" class="sbp3-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={398} y={86} size={24} />
      <text x="424" y="90" class="sbp3-hdr sbp3-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>MP Buy 2,000 shares → sweeps all 3 tiers</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh MP Mua 2.000 CP → quét sạch cả 3 bậc</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="424" y="122" class="sbp3-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Average fill: 25,362.5 VND (+312.5 đ slippage/share)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giá khớp bình quân: 25.362,5 đồng (trượt +312,5 đ/CP)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Bottom right: LO capped */}
      <rect x="370" y="172" width="510" height="102" rx="10" class="sbp3-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="shield" x={398} y={204} size={24} />
      <text x="424" y="208" class="sbp3-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>LO Buy 2,000 @ 25,050 → capped by your price</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh LO Mua 2.000 @ 25.050 → khóa trần đúng giá bạn chọn</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="424" y="240" class="sbp3-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Fills 500 @ 25,050 immediately; 1,500 wait at 25,050</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp ngay 500 @ 25.050; 1.500 CP còn lại xếp chờ tại 25.050</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>An MP order guarantees speed, never price. When Ask 1 only holds 500 shares, a 2,000-share MP order marches straight up to Ask 3 at 25,600 VND — costing an extra 625,000 VND in slippage across one order.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Lệnh thị trường (MP) đảm bảo khớp nhanh chứ không đảm bảo giá. Khi Ask 1 chỉ treo 500 cổ phiếu, lệnh MP mua 2.000 cổ phiếu sẽ quét thẳng lên Ask 3 giá 25.600 đồng — mất thêm 625.000 đồng trượt giá ngay trên một lệnh.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp3-mp { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp3-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp3-mp svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp3-mp text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp3-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp3-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .sbp3-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp3-hdr { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp3-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp3-body { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp3-sub { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp3-sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp3-mp figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
